msgid "Шрифт удалён."
msgstr "The font has been deleted."

#: inc/admin/admin-page.php:178
msgid ""
"Не удалось загрузить шрифт. Проверьте формат файла: WOFF2, WOFF, TTF или "
"OTF."
msgstr ""
"The font could not be uploaded. Check the file format: WOFF2, WOFF, TTF or "
"OTF."

